OL,3,CMajor wildfire continues in
OL,4,CNottinghamshire as crews tackle to put
OL,5,Cout blaze
OL,7,FFirefighters are continuing to battle
OL,8,Fa major wildfire on woodland which saw
OL,9,Fmultiple crews responds.
OL,11,FCrews from Nottinghamshire Fire and
OL,12,FRescue Service have remained on site
OL,13,Fovernight at an open fire on
OL,14,FStrawberry Hill Heath, Mansfield which
OL,15,Fstarted at around 2pm on Saturday
OL,16,F(August 8).
OL,18,FAt its height, the blaze covered a
OL,19,Flarge area of woodland and shrubbery.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
