PN,34202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786295966
OL,3,CMajor wildfire continues in
OL,4,CNottinghamshire as crews tackle to put
OL,5,Cout blaze
OL,7,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue
OL,8,FService have now said that they expect
OL,9,Ffirefighting to continue throughout
OL,10,FSunday.
OL,12,FThe fire service has eight engines, a
OL,13,Fhigh volume pump, command support and
OL,14,Fa welfare unit in attendance, with
OL,15,Fofficials reporting that approximately
OL,16,F36,000sqm of woodland and undergrowth
OL,17,Fhave been affected by the incident.
OL,19,FThat is the equivalent of about seven
OL,20,Ffootball pitches.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786295966
OL,3,CMajor wildfire continues in
OL,4,CNottinghamshire as crews tackle to put
OL,5,Cout blaze
OL,7,FThis is not the first time the Heath
OL,8,Fhas seen fire this summer - in July
OL,9,Fanother open fire took crews multiple
OL,10,Fdays to get under control.
OL,12,FA spokesperson for Nottinghamshire
OL,13,FFire and Rescue Service has said:
OL,14,F"Crews have remained on site overnight
OL,15,Fat the fire on Strawberry Hill Heath.
OL,16,FPlease avoid the area, and if local
OL,17,Fresidents are affected by the smoke,
OL,18,Fkeep doors and windows closed."
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786295966
OL,3,CMajor wildfire continues in
OL,4,CNottinghamshire as crews tackle to put
OL,5,Cout blaze
OL,7,FAt the peak of the fire, 12 crews, the
OL,8,FJoint Police/Fire drone team, command
OL,9,Fsupport and a water carrier were all
OL,10,Fat the site.
OL,12,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service is
OL,13,Falso on site to offer support due to
OL,14,Fthe size of the fire.
OL,16,FThis comes as the Met Office has
OL,17,Fconfirmed that July 2026 was the
OL,18,Fdriest on record, with England
OL,19,Freceiving just seven per cent of the
OL,20,Flong-term average rainfall for July.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
