PN,34205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786295966
OL,3,CMajor wildfire continues in
OL,4,CNottinghamshire as crews tackle to put
OL,5,Cout blaze
OL,7,FNottinghamshire has also recorded
OL,8,Ftemperature records, as June saw the
OL,9,Fcounty record its highest ever night-
OL,10,Ftime temperature for June when the
OL,11,Fmercury hit 21.3C.
OL,13,FStrawberry Hill Heath is a designated
OL,14,Farea of special scientific interest
OL,15,Fmeaning the land is protected due to
OL,16,Fthe important of it's wildlife,
OL,17,Fplants, animals, geology or landforms.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
