PN,34206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786295966
OL,3,CMajor wildfire continues in
OL,4,CNottinghamshire as crews tackle to put
OL,5,Cout blaze
OL,7,FThe Heath is particularly important as
OL,8,Fit is a lowland heath, which is a rare
OL,9,Fhabitat as heaths are typically on
OL,10,Fhigh ground.
OL,12,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue
OL,13,FService has urged people to "avoid the
OL,14,Farea" while crews continue to manage
OL,15,Fthe fire.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/6
